# Privacy and cookies

IndieFund **does not and will not** use advertising cookies or remarketing pixels.

## Banned (require explicit legal review to add)

- Meta/Facebook Pixel, Google Ads tags, TikTok Pixel, Twitter/X ad tags
- Criteo, Taboola, Outbrain, or any ad network / remarketing SDK

## Analytics

- First-party server-side analytics (`FanJourneyEvent`) is the default
- Third-party analytics cookies may only be added via **Iubenda consent** with prior blocking — never advertising

## Legal docs

- Setup: `legal/IUBENDA_SETUP.md`
- Banner config: `legal/IUBENDA_BANNER_CONFIG.md`
- Guardrails: `legal/README.md`
